bff82de5-5e12-4f64-929d-c65ca50bf6fe	0ae00c7c-f0d5-4440-9495-f3b3d44dd6d0	2	Người đề nghị bổ nhiệm công chứng viên phải có đủ các tiêu chuẩn quy định\ntại Điều 10 của Luật Công chứng: Là công dân Việt Nam không quá 70 tuổi; thường trú\ntại Việt Nam, tuân thủ Hiến pháp và pháp luật, có phẩm chất đạo đức tốt và bảo đảm sức\nkhỏe để hành nghề công chứng; có bằng cử nhân luật hoặc thạc sĩ luật hoặc tiến sĩ luật;\ncó thời gian công tác pháp luật từ đủ 03 năm trở lên tại cơ quan, tổ chức sau khi có bằng\ncử nhân luật hoặc thạc sĩ luật hoặc tiến sĩ luật; tốt nghiệp khóa đào tạo nghề công chứng;\nđạt yêu cầu kiểm tra kết quả tập sự hành nghề công chứng. 2.	\N	\N	[-0.073517926,0.052170206,-0.038557887,0.00511591,0.009608714,-0.069415525,0.00061588926,0.03402197,0.031823874,-0.07806612,-0.052140757,0.08164951,0.010301852,0.0074031455,-0.06796759,0.055246156,0.024736542,0.018609993,-0.082297735,-0.060316473,0.02794553,0.03301717,-0.05031328,-0.02598752,-0.013670471,0.04180062,0.034340613,-0.08186287,-0.028077986,0.054873746,-0.015706789,0.05595497,0.0217973,0.06991333,0.060058445,0.009252585,-0.012931391,-0.021900952,-0.04075204,0.045686994,-0.06964899,-0.04844093,0.023591682,-0.034427427,-0.04000589,0.05618984,-0.028466322,0.010813367,-0.0022820563,0.10576199,-0.05898512,-0.010205127,0.041977957,-0.06856352,0.00715784,0.04727894,0.0021773654,-0.0013824607,0.09205269,0.020930799,-0.005130047,-0.004910452,-0.056546707,-0.03609347,-0.017137116,0.046025343,0.01610906,-0.04021596,0.025427572,0.02377139,-0.060691893,0.010318417,-0.02533108,0.0277452,0.04373245,0.05210837,-0.034864247,0.03583627,-0.08013723,0.01453081,-0.0447066,-0.03887303,-0.038822353,-0.046634097,0.00026434482,-0.069188625,0.0100920405,-0.038753472,-0.0037817734,0.014036909,0.052216154,0.019621989,-0.039890137,0.0068875016,-0.0023546882,0.0331231,0.004269309,0.02742719,0.07389996,0.0056976,-0.056943968,-0.0005874102,0.034296352,0.011784064,-0.023277817,0.0011412775,-0.031271614,0.033116482,0.010616453,0.00870897,