 tư số 281/2016/TT-BTC ngày 14/11/2016 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Tài\nchính quy định mức thu, chế độ thu, nộp, quản lý và sử dụng phí khai thác, sử\ndụng thông tin trong cơ sở dữ liệu hộ tịch, phí xác nhận có quốc tịch Việt Nam, phí\nxác nhận là người gốc Việt Nam, lệ phí quốc tịch;\n- Thông tư số 85/2019/TT-BTC ngày 29/11/2019 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Tài\nchính hướng dẫn về phí và lệ phí thuộc thẩm quyền quyết định của Hội đồng nhân\ndân tỉnh, thành phố trực thuộc Trungương;\n- Thông tư số 106/2021/TT-BTC ngày 26/11/2021 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Tài\nchính sửa đổi, bổ sung một số điều của Thông tư số 85/2019/TT-BTC ngày\n29/11/2019 của Bộ Tài chính hướng dẫn về phí và lệ phí thuộc thẩm quyền\nquyết định của Hội đồng nhân dân tỉnh, thành phố trực thuộc Trungương.	\N	\N	[-0.049392506,0.06363654,-0.058071207,0.033292152,-0.05010638,-0.019522276,-0.061472133,0.023622638,0.08518848,-0.040468,-0.010805353,0.042758614,0.005913038,0.015895505,-0.05302184,0.022387492,0.033023644,0.056025855,-0.12835996,0.065227434,0.056318723,0.057753038,-0.07722993,0.017247953,-0.024776394,0.08506972,-0.004674799,-0.07418626,0.013572691,0.064641096,-0.036489017,0.0103221685,-0.011290653,0.02943497,0.007169098,-0.02007493,0.01919395,0.08766477,-0.07014311,0.006213149,0.021657016,0.021154344,-0.018388165,-0.031972494,0.008530993,0.014484317,-0.07161578,0.06200173,0.0115919635,0.048756957,-0.030953264,0.014151421,0.038622268,-0.04570605,-0.016685795,0.11409108,-0.06869578,-0.026418336,0.062650666,0.02951882,-0.008791332,-0.003454805,0.018258307,-0.06267445,-0.015781395,0.017762253,0.020194964,-0.026515994,0.027246708,-0.00899959,0.00884732,-0.0043849302,0.0149293,-0.068064325,-0.009142928,0.024566127,-0.055098083,0.044395607,-0.011947334,0.059025545,-0.012067366,0.011719813,-0.024668634,-0.090555854,5.1240863e-06,0.0631297,0.008807189,-0.056575943,0.007653147,0.018240342,0.030336618,0.00017900193,-0.060620286,-0.015653664,0.02491955,0.0013183721,0.004216582,-0.010123093,0.05058849,0.05092176,0.005550138,0.06541584,0