b1e2cff8-7ba4-4484-9f28-a732eed9db95	229b691d-716e-4f0a-846f-dca73efe40bc	9	STTTên biểu mẫu/ hồ sơ Nơi lưu/ người lưu trữThời gian lưu\n01Bộ hồ sơ theo Mục 5.aỦy ban nhân dân cấp xã/Công\nchức Tư pháp-Hộ tịchVĩnh viễn\n02Sổ đăng ký khai sinhỦy ban nhân dân cấp xã/Công\nchức Tư pháp-Hộ tịchVĩnh viễn\n03Kết quả giải quyết thủ tục hành\nchính: Giấy khai sinh (bản photo)Ủy ban nhân dân cấp xã/Công\nchức Tư pháp Hộ tịchVĩnh viễn\nCỘNG HOÀ XÃ HỘI CHỦ NGHĨA VIỆT NAM\nTỜ KHAI ĐĂNG KÝ NHẬN CHA, MẸ, CON\nchấp và chịu trách nhiệm trước pháp luật về cam đoan của mình. Ý kiến của người hiện đang là mẹ hoặc cha(5)\nĐề nghị cấp bản sao(6): Có\nsố định danh cá nhân/căn cước công dân/t hẻ căn cước/căn cước điện tử. Trường hợp phải cung cấp thông tin “Nơi cư trú” thì ghi theo nơi đăng ký thường trú;\nnếu không có nơi đăng ký thường trú thì ghi theo nơi đăng ký tạm trú; trường hợp không có\nnơi đăng ký thường trú và nơi đăng ký tạm trú thì ghi theo nơi ở hiện tại.	\N	\N	[-0.0775444,-0.013648182,-0.026397316,0.051444624,-0.05329602,-0.023029488,-0.029380247,0.057284985,0.08172452,-0.0408117,-0.0019939486,-0.06565063,0.017575977,-0.014557129,-0.08321609,0.060327534,0.013330052,0.016070694,-0.0928218,-0.018843403,0.0037433037,0.03830067,-0.020869708,0.07085525,0.015404987,0.091208346,0.054935876,-0.09985733,-0.116874896,0.04060207,-0.035666093,0.05369644,-0.008711197,0.06682561,0.031449795,0.031636853,0.031138211,0.045387547,0.019677304,-0.017114218,0.0002496257,0.026991544,0.033091843,-0.02098277,-0.0139216175,-0.0019743184,-0.052573565,0.015983585,-0.006276059,0.017634533,0.02310488,-0.003316907,0.027627284,-0.059616663,0.022840206,0.13035844,-0.05100135,0.02121081,0.030632459,-0.008555731,0.012645302,-0.0039230394,0.010741725,-0.023642708,0.046755183,0.02819472,0.036666773,0.004630257,0.026260523,-0.007863217,-0.1191723,0.058329884,0.02354514,-0.062488705,0.024863267,0.021725258,-0.011883395,-0.008090757,-0.047344856,0.012711649,-0.028382093,-0.0062241307,-0.0097736865,-0.054752164,-0