0e77db8a-61bf-45ca-80dd-1cf72aa079f4	40dded61-b99e-4f12-bfa6-3e4ba014d863	11	Chúng tôi chịu hoàn toàn trách nhiệm trước pháp luật về nội dung cam đoan của mình. Đề nghị Quý cơ quan đăng ký.\n(Ký, ghi rõ họ, chữ đệm, tên)\n(Ký, ghi rõ họ, chữ đệm, tên)\nĐề nghị cấp bản sao(6): Có\nTên quy trình: Đăng ký kết hôn\nSố lượng: …….bản\n(1) (2) Trường hợp làm thủ tục đăng ký kết hôn có yếu tố nước ngoài, thì phải dánảnh của hai\nbên nam, nữ.\ndanh cá nhân/căn cước công dân/ thẻ căn cước/căn cước điện tử. Trường hợp phải cung cấp thông tin “Nơi cư trú” thì ghi theo nơi đăng ký thường trú; nếu\nkhông có nơi đăng ký thường trú thì ghi theo nơi đăng ký tạm trú; trường hợp không có nơi đăng\nký thường trú và nơi đăng ký tạm trú thì ghi theo nơi ở hiện tại.\ncước công dân số 025188001010 do Cục Cảnh sát QLHC về TTXH cấp ngày 20/11/2021) .	\N	\N	[-0.07733937,0.05586342,-0.0027376923,-0.012237342,0.0044836593,0.023701053,-0.068211205,0.038476903,0.060131207,-0.092119254,-0.012456511,0.004853003,-0.013862215,-0.03045197,-0.09480085,0.10665168,0.015772581,-0.032927725,-0.06872017,-0.009397191,-0.049086954,0.033524293,-0.038509455,0.022947814,0.019077249,0.11287673,0.042876214,-0.046076395,-0.063307054,0.07247435,-0.07683666,0.01295574,0.00724305,0.07943453,-5.713976e-06,-0.021741265,-0.025598885,0.026361879,-0.03150855,0.038232245,0.010526618,0.029980682,-0.029514506,0.012358739,-0.042301707,-0.011864561,-0.00062650343,-0.0028988493,-0.014647507,-0.008396039,-0.080293275,-0.010452393,0.049388666,-0.023062907,0.04020541,0.04931573,-0.09327525,-0.004518478,0.031553973,-0.0077988678,-0.012989806,-0.003303176,-0.06326771,-0.0034221213,-0.0097432425,0.010023604,0.05240465,-0.0025769798,0.04853297,-0.004861357,-0.1295864,0.007224753,-0.0027902252,-0.014863538,0.051133964,0.039120488,-0.024835559,-0.0073586185,-0.031415258,0.02359355,0.033060934,-0.021831043,0.022018673,-0.059372015,-0.026862752,-0.055524956,0.09146667,-0.015880564,-0.04413756,0.023500862,0.0032891664,0.062124725,-0.0793842