\nmẫu sổ quốc tịch và mẫu giấy tờ về quốc tịch và Thông tư số 04/2020/TT-BTP\nngày 28/5/2020 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Tư pháp quy định chi tiết thi hành một số\nđiều của Luật Hộ tịch và Nghị định số 123/2015/NĐ-CP ngày 15/11/2015 của\nChính phủ quy định chi tiết một số điều và biện pháp thi hành Luật Hộ tịch;\n- Thông tư số 08/2025/TT-BTP ngày 12/6/2025 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Tư\npháp quy định về phân định thẩm quyền của chính quyền địa phương 02 cấp và\nphân cấp trong lĩnh vực quản lý nhà nước của Bộ Tư pháp;\n- Thông tư số 281/2016/TT-BTC ngày 14/11/2016 của Bộ trưởng Bộ Tài\nchính quy định mức thu, chế độ thu, nộp, quản lý và sử dụng phí khai thác, sử\ndụng thông tin trong cơ sở dữ liệu hộ tịch, phí xác nhận có quốc tịch Việt Nam, phí\nxác nhận là người gốc Việt Nam, lệ phí quốc tịch.	\N	\N	[-0.07041278,0.05636299,-0.043114416,0.031189382,-0.052776292,0.0031934807,-0.073390566,0.03351843,0.07036057,-0.05934018,-0.012374831,0.06309268,0.023128113,-0.010266317,-0.05897671,0.011170685,0.051183913,0.02467689,-0.1321021,0.022056557,0.031933956,0.030450827,-0.048831277,0.030527703,0.010449383,0.093958355,0.006555156,-0.08649604,0.0029590947,0.05989791,-0.045219354,0.013529334,0.0031271959,0.02376939,-0.0004986505,-0.0113989515,0.024561683,0.087457485,-0.049869347,0.0055873385,-0.004058797,0.0011210156,0.00010468674,0.0038133198,0.028869176,0.009812041,-0.038551666,0.07103939,-0.0066333143,0.045572244,-0.032007802,0.016651133,0.042908914,-0.025328364,-0.0015827921,0.099052146,-0.05862731,-0.0071549094,0.060680743,0.013477865,-0.029750736,-0.0034990683,0.034074116,-0.0545847,-0.0027425613,0.0238603,0.030452523,-0.017970283,0.038673077,-0.004990108,-0.033574212,0.027111907,0.046689607,-0.057154834,0.025116952,0.021972613,-0.060230844,0.025969772,0.008654357,0.040550463,0.009797572,0.026254497,0.001433218,-0.059323553,0.0008444535,0.03187674,-0.014277558,-0.001445639,0.034311507,0.044700842,0.04766321,-0.012513597,-0.058639143,0.009817633,0.00965519,-0.008539539,-0.0045517865,-0.0127826